Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 16:03:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bind the strict HQ entry to one approved server account.

generateHqStructuredJson refuses a missing or divergent account, workspace, model, billing kind, or catalog revision before any reservation or fetch. Subscription and verified free stay non_api_authorized. The legacy path without a catalog is unchanged and is not a security proof.
